<header class="SectionHeader SectionHeader--center"><h3 class="SectionHeader__SubHeading Heading u-h6" style="text-align:left;">What we do?</h3>
<p style="text-align:left;">At Story Tailor, we are a team of professionally creative, mindful, and savvy individuals who believe in the power of storytelling and its impact on children's lives. We are Dev's parents, and our journey began when we compared our own childhood experiences to those of children today. We realized the importance of preserving the magic of childhood and decided to take action.</p>
<p style="text-align:left;">In our nostalgic reflections, we missed the enchantment of storytellers and the vast array of stories that once inspired mischief and ignited our imaginations. We longed to bring back those cherished memories and share them with Dev and his Gen Alpha gang. With a firm belief that a stitch in time saves nine, we embarked on a mission to combine our skills and reimagine our own childhoods for the benefit of Dev and his peers.</p>
</header>
</div>
